  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4602.07 Access to Records. Pursuant to RSA 359-T:13, III, all records, accounts and documents shall be accessible for inspection by the bureau or any authorized representative of the bureau, during business hours.\n\nSource. #5852, eff 6-23-94; ss by #7240, eff 6-23-00, EXPIRED: 6-23-08\n\nNew. #9379, eff 1-30-09; ss by #12358, eff 8-2-17; ss by #13828, eff 12-22-23 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 4600)",
